## Quickstart
```bash
# local (Python 3.11+)
pip install -r requirements.txt && pip install -e .
streamlit run app/Home.py

# rebuild every number from scratch (about 2 hours on a laptop CPU)
make data train bench                              # Case A
make data-steady train-steady pinn bench-steady    # Cases B, C and the PINN baseline

# optional: LLM drafting in the Go-to-Market Studio (Claude API)
PHYSICSVETO_MOCK=0 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... streamlit run app/Home.py

# Docker
docker compose up      # then open http://localhost:8501
```
**Streamlit Community Cloud:** New app → this repo → main file `app/Home.py`. Weights and results are committed,
so the hosted app runs inference only.

